    "Software"  the material described immediately above.
    "Owner"     the copyright holder named at the top of this file.
    "You"       any person or entity reading or using the Software.

A2. YOU MAY

    a. View, read and study the Software, in full, for any purpose.
    b. Quote excerpts in commentary, teaching, review, journalism or research,
       with attribution to SAWAH.
    c. Fork this repository, modify your fork, and run it on your own machine
       for the single purpose of preparing a contribution offered back to the
       Owner under section A4.

A3. YOU MAY NOT

    Without prior written permission from the Owner:

    a. Deploy, host, publish or otherwise make the Software available to anyone
       else, modified or unmodified, in whole or in part.
    b. Use the Software or any part of it to build, run or operate any product,
       service or website, whether or not it resembles SAWAH, and whether or not
       money changes hands.
    c. Sell, rent, lease, sublicense or otherwise commercialise the Software, or
       charge anyone for access to it or to anything built from it.
    d. Distribute the Software, or any modified version of it, to any third
       party.
    e. Create or keep a modified version of the Software for any purpose other
       than the contribution route in A2(c).
    f. Remove or obscure this Licence, or any copyright or attribution notice.

    Reading it is free. Running it for anyone but yourself is not.

A3b. FORKING, AND WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT CLAIM

    If this repository is published on a platform whose terms give other users
    the right to fork public repositories, that right comes from the platform,
    not from this Licence, and this Licence does not purport to remove it.

    What this Licence governs is what you may do with a copy once you have one.
    Preparing a contribution under A2(c) is permitted. Deploying it, publishing
    it, distributing it, building a product on it, or keeping a modified version
    for any other purpose is not, and remains restricted by copyright whether or
    not the copy was obtained by forking.

A4. CONTRIBUTIONS

